     "title_type": "TV Series",
     "description": "Rebel (2021) is a crime-drama series starring Katey Sagal, John Corbett, and Lex Scott Davis that follows a blue-collar legal advocate who helps people without a law degree, drawing inspiration from the activism of Erin Brockovich. Across serialized character arcs and case-driven episodes, the show blends courtroom tension, medical and corporate stakes, and family dynamics. Its emotional tone is hopeful and empathetic, emphasizing grassroots advocacy and moral resolve while mixing sharp humor with serious social themes.",
     "finale_year": 2021,
     "wikidata_id": null,
     "plot_summary": "A blue-collar legal advocate uses street smarts and tenacity to help people who lack access to traditional legal resources, taking on corporations and powerful interests without a law degree. Episodes mix case-of-the-week courtroom tension with serialized family and community stories, often exposing medical and corporate stakes. The series is inspired by the activism of Erin Brockovich and centers on empathy, grassroots advocacy, and moral resolve.",
