     "title_type": "TV Series",
     "description": "East New York (2022) is a crime drama television series starring Amanda Warren alongside Kevin Rankin, Richard Kind and Jimmy Smits, presented as a police procedural set in Brooklyn's 74th Precinct. The show centers on a deputy inspector who leads a diverse ensemble of officers through casework and precinct politics while managing community relations. Episodes mix investigative mysteries with serialized character development, highlighting themes of leadership, diversity, and professional and personal struggles. The tone is earnest and realistic, emphasizing grounded performances and neighborhood-focused storytelling.",
